WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.186
Meet Point of Sale, from Club Steward. One checkout, for the whole club.

2
00:00:05.486 --> 00:00:11.731
The dining room, the bar, the pro shop, and the halfway house all use the same checkout, so your staff learn it once.

3
00:00:13.631 --> 00:00:19.303
Find the member, and charge it to their account. No cash, no cards, and no chasing at month end.

4
00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:26.449
Range balls with a tee time, a lesson with a court booking. The charge travels with the booking.

5
00:00:28.349 --> 00:00:31.816
And every charge lands on the member's statement, the moment it's made.

6
00:00:33.715 --> 00:00:36.164
Point of Sale, part of Club Steward, by Ardn.
